{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Tongue Lash|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Tahm Kench
|skill        = Q
|icon         = Tongue Lash.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Tahm Kench}} lashes his tongue in the target direction that deals {{as|magic damage}} to the first enemy hit and shortly {{tip|slows}} them. If this hits an enemy {{tip|champion}}, '''Tahm Kench''' also {{tip|heals}} based on {{as|his '''missing''' health}}. 
|blurb4      = {{sbc|{{ai|An Acquired Taste|Tahm Kench}} Bonus:}} The target is briefly {{tip|stun|stunned}}. ''{{ai|Devour|Tahm Kench}}'' can be cast during ''Tongue Lash'' at no cost to {{tip|airborne|pull}} the target to '''Tahm Kench''' before swallowing them.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Tahm Kench''' lashes his tongue in the target direction that deals {{as|magic damage}} to the first enemy hit and {{tip|slows}} them by 50% for 2 seconds. If this hits an enemy {{tip|champion}}, '''Tahm Kench''' also {{tip|heals}} himself.
|leveling     = {{st|Magic Damage|{{ap|75 to 255}} {{as|(+ 100% AP)}} + [ {{ai|An Acquired Taste|Tahm Kench|icononly=true}} {{pp|5 to 60 for 12}} {{as|({{as|+ {{fd|1.25}}% AP}} {{as|per 100 '''bonus''' health)|hp}} {{as|(+ 4% '''bonus''' health)}}}} ]}}
{{st|Heal|{{ap|10 to 30}} {{as|(+ {{ap|5 to 7}}% of '''missing''' health)}}}}
|description2 = {{sbc|{{ai|An Acquired Taste|Tahm Kench}} Bonus:}} The target is {{tip|stun|stunned}} for {{fd|1.5}} seconds. ''{{ai|Devour|Tahm Kench}}'' can be cast during ''Tongue Lash'' at no cost to pull the target to '''Tahm Kench''' before swallowing them.
|description4 = '''''Tahm Kench''' is {{tip|lockout|unable}} to move, attack, or cast {{ai|Abyssal Dive|Tahm Kench}} or {{ai|Devour|Tahm Kench}} on a different target while his tongue is in flight. Tongue Lash's range and travel speed can be increased by '''Tahm Kench's''' {{tip|size}}.''
|range        = {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|900|Increased by size modifiers}}
|width        = {{tip|er|icononly = true}} 140
|speed        = {{tt|2800|Increased by size modifiers}}
|cast time    = {{fd|0.25}}
|cooldown     = {{ap|7 to 5}}
|cost         = {{ap|50 to 34}}
|costtype     = Mana
|targeting    = Direction
|damagetype   = Magic
|projectile   = True
|spelleffects = Spell
|spellshield  = True
|affects      = Enemies
|notes   = 
* '''Tongue Lash's''' range and speed scale 1:1 alongside any {{tip|size}} modifiers to '''Tahm Kench''', but will not be reduced ''below'' their base values if his overall size modifier is smaller than 100%.
** As the missile range and speed scale simultaneously, '''Tongue Lash''' will always take {{rutngt|{{#expr: 900/2800}}}} to reach its maximum range (no matter the cast range).
** Because of this, increasing '''Tahm Kench's''' size with items such as {{ii|Elixir of Iron}} allows him to hit targets at even the same distance more quickly and giving them less time to dodge.
* {{ai|Devour|Tahm Kench}} can be 'queued' at any point during ''Tongue Lash'' (including the wind-up animation) and will not go on cooldown if '''Tahm Kench''' fails to hit a valid target with ''Tongue Lash''.
* All three {{ai|An Acquired Taste|Tahm Kench}} stacks will be consumed even if ''Tongue Lash's'' {{tip|stun}} is negated.
{{Effect at cast time start}}
{{ct|cast|spells=true,false,false,false,false}}
}}

{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Thick Skin|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Tahm Kench
|skill        = E
|icon         = false
|blurb        = {{sbc|Passive:}} {{ci|Tahm Kench}} stores [[Health#Grey health|grey health]] equal to a portion of damage taken, increased while he is near at least 2 enemy champions.
|blurb2      = While ''Thick Skin'' is off cooldown, and after a few seconds without taking damage, '''Tahm Kench''' rapidly consumes his grey health to {{tip|heal}} up to a portion.
|blurb3      = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Tahm Kench''' converts his grey health into a {{tip|shield}} that lasts a short time.
|description  = {{sbc|Passive:}} '''Tahm Kench''' stores a portion of the {{tt|post-mitigation damage|Damage calculated after modifiers}} he takes as [[Health#Grey health|grey health]] on his [[health bar]], increased while there are at least 2 nearby {{tip|sight|visible}} enemy champions either dead or alive. He can store up to {{as|300% of his '''maximum''' health}}.
|leveling     = {{st|Damage Stored into Grey Health|{{ap|15 to 47}}%}}
{{st|Increased Damage Stored into Grey Health|{{ap|42 to 50}}%}}
|description2 = While ''Thick Skin'' is not on cooldown, and after 4 seconds without taking damage, '''Tahm Kench''' rapidly consumes his [[Health#Grey health|grey health]] to restore {{pp|key=%|60 to 100}} of the amount, {{tip|healing}} for {{as|10% of his '''maximum''' health}} every {{rutngt|0.25}}.
|icon3        = Thick Skin.png
|description3 = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Tahm Kench''' converts his current [[Health#Grey health|grey health]] into a {{tip|shield}} that lasts for {{fd|2.5}} seconds.
|cooldown     = {{tt|3|Starts upon shield destruction or expiration}}
|cdstart      = post-effect
|cast time    = {{fd|0.25}}
|effect radius= {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|2400|Search radius for enemy champions}}
|targeting    = Auto
|affects      = Self
|spelleffects = 
|notes   = 
* ''Thick Skin'' shield value and ''grey health'' percentage heal are both boosted by effects that increase heal and shield power. This means '''Tahm Kench''' can technically heal more than the normal amount of ''grey health'' and get a shield bigger than his maximum health.
** At level 18 '''Tahm Kench''' would need {{ap|(1/0.65-1)*100|round=1}}% {{sti|heal power}} to heal for 100% of the damage he takes, reduced to {{ap|(1/(0.65*1.1)-1.05)*100|round=1}}% with {{ri|Revitalize}}, {{ap|(1/(0.65*1.25)-1)*100|round=1}}% with {{ii|Spirit Visage}}, and {{ap|(1/(0.65*1.1*1.25)-1.05)*100|round=1}}% with both.
* ''Grey health'' converts all post-mitigation damage, ''Thick Skin'' effectively grants ''Tahm Kench'' a form of {{as|true damage}} mitigation.
* ''Grey health'' can temporarily exceed 100% of his missing health when '''Tahm Kench''' {{tt|heals through other means|Any other source of healing besides Thick Skin}} with a ''grey health'' bar at 100%. In that case he will keep the higher ''grey health'' value for a few moments until it updates and removes the amount that he healed.
}}

